      <title>Anthropic掌门人称“中国因素”是放缓AI竞赛的最大难题</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260914/Anthropic%E6%8E%8C%E9%97%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%9B%A0%E7%B4%A0%E6%98%AF%E6%94%BE%E7%BC%93AI%E7%AB%9E%E8%B5%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E9%9A%BE%E9%A2%98/</link>
